{"parentUuid":"b6873c7f-17b4-4b80-a203-910152dbeaaa","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/galex/src/github.com/galexy/edgar-diff","sessionId":"3be36cf1-d252-4d7f-914a-5d10025154c8","version":"2.1.56","gitBranch":"main","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01UUDTmHaVCeaWx8gW9w2amw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes! Based on the project's CLAUDE.md, **beads** (`bd`) is a lightweight issue tracker with first-class dependency support. Here's a quick overview of the most common operations:\n\n**Core workflow:**\n- `bd create` — Create a new issue\n- `bd list` — List issues\n- `bd show <id>` — Show issue details\n- `bd update <id>` — Update an issue\n- `bd close <id>` — Close an issue\n\n**Dependencies & structure:**\n- `bd dep` — Manage dependencies between issues\n- `bd graph` — Visualize the dependency graph\n- `bd children <id>` — List child issues\n- `bd blocked` — Show blocked issues\n- `bd ready` — Show work that's ready (open, no blockers)\n\n**Quick capture & search:**\n- `bd q` — Quick create, outputs only the ID\n- `bd search <query>` — Search by text\n- `bd query <expr>` — Query with a simple query language\n\n**Sync & version control:**\n- `bd sync` — Export database to JSONL\n- `bd branch` — Manage branches (Dolt backend)\n\n**Useful flags:**\n- `--json` — JSON output\n- `-q` / `--quiet` — Suppress non-essential output\n- `-v` / `--verbose` — Debug output\n\nThe project's landing-the-plane workflow also requires `bd sync` before pushing to remote.\n\nWant me to do something specific with beads, like listing current issues or creating a new one?"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3102,"cache_read_input_tokens":18792,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3102},"output_tokens":13,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYVv8KY2aF8R8NU7sivLg","type":"ass